5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to stop guessing. Who is actually paying for what?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Clarity is good, but let's ensure it doesn't turn into surveillance.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need the car to be ready when I need it. No surprises.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Guesswork is inefficient. We need hard data to allocate costs fairly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the time spent untangling who owes what.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, data helps, but we must define what 'fair' means first.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, time is a cost too. We should minimize administrative burden.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, fairness is useless if the car is dirty or missing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, precision prevents resentment. I will look into the receipts.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, yes. I want to see where the coordination hours go.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the tax and insurance papers to see the baseline.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I want to understand what sours groups like ours. I will check the audit history.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the handover state and the mechanic's remarks.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the fuel receipts and the recorded hours.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the hours of use and the weekly trips.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let's see what the numbers say before we argue.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. Let's find the root cause, not just the symptom.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I just want a car that works. Let's get to the facts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,The data will speak for itself. I trust the logic.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope it simplifies things. I am tired of the mental load.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
