35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The fixed costs are 280k. But fuel is wildly uneven.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,I found that auditing each other caused the most friction.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The car is often dirty and low on fuel when I get it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The fuel receipts show two people bought over half the fuel.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The diary shows weekends are triple the usage of weekdays.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, that confirms my suspicion. A flat split is unfair.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, but if we track fuel, we start checking each other again.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, I don't care about the math. I care about the mess.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, friction is the price of accuracy. I prefer accuracy.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, accuracy costs me evenings of arranging. I can't do that.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need a system that accounts for usage without constant policing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The other households said the problem was asking for favours.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The mechanic said short trips ruin the car. We need longer, planned runs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If we know the hours, we can price the time.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The weekly trips are the problem. They are rigid and unpredictable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"So, we need to balance the fixed cost with the variable usage.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,And we must avoid the 'checking' trap. It poisons the well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I need a guarantee of condition. Not just a price.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"A price per hour, plus a base fee. It is logical.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to stop calculating who owes me money.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
