60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option B seems most equitable, but it requires constant logging.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option C risks the 'favour' dynamic I saw in the other households.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
