63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option B is the only one that reflects actual consumption.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option A feels the least stressful. I just know my days.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, but if we log every trip, we are back to auditing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, exactly. The audit is the sore point. We must avoid it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, Option A avoids the audit. I pay my share, I use my days.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, but what if I need the car on your day?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, you ask. If I can't, you wait. It is simple.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
