74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,Option A minimizes the mental effort. I don't have to track anything.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minako,,"I am leaning towards A for stability, but B for fairness.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I vote for A. It preserves the peace. The audit is the enemy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I vote for A. Reliability is more important than perfect accounting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shion,,I vote for B. Fairness is non-negotiable. I will handle the data.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for A. I need the quiet. I can't manage the tracking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
